{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter's New Job", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Best Candidate", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to make up your mind", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200bchoose what to \u200bdo", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Have you made up your mind about what to do?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when making a decision about a candidate.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Language for Making Decisions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Decision-making is an important skill, both in the workplace and in our everyday lives. Here's some language you can use to talk about decisions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "(verb) \t<span class =\"strong\">decide</span> (not)<span class =\"strong\"> to</span>: <span class =\"italic\">I have decided to leave the company. </span><br />(noun) <span class =\"strong\">decision</span>: <span class =\"italic\">Leaving the company was a difficult decision.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You <span class =\"strong\">take</span>, <span class =\"strong\">arrive at</span>, <span class =\"strong\">come to</span> or <span class =\"strong\">make</span> a decision:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>As CEO of the company, she needs to <span class=\"strong\">make</span> tough decisions.</li><li>Have you <span class=\"strong\">arrived</span> at a decision?</li><li>Let me know when you have <span class=\"strong\">taken</span> your decision.</li><li> I will let you know once we <span class=\"strong\">come to</span> a decision.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also use <span class=\"strong\">adjectives</span> to describe your decision.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"take <br />make <br />arrive at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a <span class=\\\"strong\\\">tough </span><br />a <span class=\\\"strong\\\">difficult</span> <br />an <span class=\\\"strong\\\">important</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br />decision\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>It sounds like a difficult decision to make. She made the right decision.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you can't make a decision, you say you <span class=\"strong\">can't make up your mind</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I can't make up my mind about who's the right person for this job.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you are thinking about your choices, you say you are <span class=\"strong\">considering your options</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I'm not sure, but I'm considering my options.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you need to think about making a decision, you <span class=\"strong\">give it a lot of thought</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>It's a difficult decision and I need to give it a lot of thought.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are thinking about your decision and want to give two different opinions about someone or something, you use <span class=\"strong\">on the one hand ... on the other hand</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>On the one hand, he is really communicative. On the other hand, she is extremely perceptive. </li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Starting a Conversation With Someone You Know", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " In English, there are certain expressions and words you use to greet and start a conversation with someone you know. Look at the charts below. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Saying <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Follow-up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Hi!</li><li> Hello!</li><li> Hey!</li><li> Hiya!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>it's <span class=\\\"strong\\\">great/ nice/ good</span> to see you</li><li>It's been <span class=\\\"strong\\\">ages/a while</span></li><li>You look <span class=\\\"strong\\\">well!/ good!</span></li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Questions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>And you!</li> <li>You too!</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> <ul><li>How are you doing?</li><li> How are things?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Good, thanks.</li><li> Very well, thanks.</li><li> Not too bad, thanks.</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Hi, Sara. It's great to see you.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Hiya. You too. It's been ages.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "How are things? Very well, thanks.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to give it thought ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to carefully think about something; to consider", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have given it a lot of thought.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "software ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the sets of programs that tell a computer how to do a particular job", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I worked for a software company. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "online", "type": "name"}, {"content": " available through the Internet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He has done some work online as well.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "finance ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the management of money by large organizations", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He did his internship with a finance company. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bring to the table", "type": "name"}, {"content": "provide something that will be a benefit ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What does each candidate bring to the table?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "skilled ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who has the training and experience that is needed to do something well", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is incredibly skilled. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "innovative   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "using clever new ideas and methods", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We were surprised by how innovative he was.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "perceptive ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who notices things quickly and understands situations ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I thought he was much more perceptive than the other candidates. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "communicative ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " able to talk easily to other people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is quite communicative. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob01aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Read the situation. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose the role you want. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice talking about the situation in the role play. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Continue speaking for as long as you can.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"underline\\\">Situation:</span><br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1: </span>You are a manager. Make the decision about who to hire. Talk to the HR officer to help you make your decision. Make a decision about how to hire. <br/>  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2: </span>You are a HR officer. Help the manager make the decision about who to hire. <br/>Change  roles.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Then, switch roles with your partner. <br><br><br><br><br><br>", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue making a decision on a new job. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe a job. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le04ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">HR</span>: Hi, Janet. It's great to see you. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Hiya, you too. It's been ages. You look well.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">HR</span>: Thanks, you too. So, have you made up your mind about who's the best candidate?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Well, I haven't decided yet. I'm considering my options."}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob01re2img06.jpg", "time": "18000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">HR</span>: Right. You need to give it a lot of thought. But what do you like about them? What do they bring to the table? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: On the one hand, Eduardo is incredibly skilled and highly innovative. On the other hand, Peter is extremely perceptive and really communicative.  Peter has worked as an intern for a software company. He's done a lot of work online, especially with planning events."}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob01re2img07.jpg", "time": "40800", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">HR</span>: What about the other applicant?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Eduardo? He did his internship with a finance company.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">HR</span>: Sounds like you've got a tough decision to make. <br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">HR</span>:  Janet. It's me. I need to know if you've arrived at a decision.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Yes! After giving it a lot of thought, I decided to go with Peter. <br/><span class=\"strong\">HR</span>: Great!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le04ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le04ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about behavior and personality appropriate for jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can start a conversation with someone I know. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about making decisions.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When was the last time you had to make a decision?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Was it easy or difficult to make? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "It's time to make a decision! ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Janet has to make a decision about who to hire. Who does she choose?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"content": [], "type": "tips"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}], "type": "STI", "id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nJanet talks to the <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_2_0\">HR</span> <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_2_1\">officer</span>. What does she say?\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class = \"italic\">\u201cHR\u201d </span>is short for <span class=\"italic\">Human Resources</span>.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}, {"content": "An <span class = \"italic\">\u201cHR officer\u201d</span> is an individual who deals with employing and training people for a company.", "tip_id": 1, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Read the dialogue. Select the expressions that are used to start the conversation. \n", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "<span class = \"strong\">HR</span>: ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Hi", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "id": 2, "_data": [{"content": ", Janet.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": true, "id": 3, "_data": [{"content": " It's great to see you. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 4, "_data": [{"content": "Have you reviewed the files I sent you?<br/>", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 5, "_data": [{"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Janet</span>: ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": true, "id": 6, "_data": [{"content": "Hiya. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": true, "id": 7, "_data": [{"content": "It's been ages. You look well.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 8, "_data": [{"content": "I haven't had a chance to.  <br/>", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 9, "_data": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">HR</span>:    ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 10, "_data": [{"content": "Thanks, you too.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 11, "_data": [{"content": " Not a problem,", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 12, "_data": [{"content": "I'll give you a call later to discuss it.<br/>", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 13, "_data": [{"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Janet</span>: ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 14, "_data": [{"content": "Sounds like a plan. <br/>", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}]}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "id": 1, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">HR</span>:  ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": false, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Janet. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": true, "id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "It's me.<br>", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 3, "_data": [{"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Janet</span>: ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 4, "_data": [{"content": "Yes,", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": true, "id": 5, "_data": [{"content": "hello.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 6, "_data": [{"content": "I looked at the files. <br>", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 7, "_data": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">HR</span>:    ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": false, "id": 8, "_data": [{"content": "Great!", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "id": 9, "_data": [{"content": "What do you think?", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": ""}]}], "type": "SLS", "id": 2, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nJanet has to choose one of the <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_3_0\">applicants</span>. Who will she choose?\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 2", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_f